{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/ecb4a65f2c9007fe3acfe3669a347aae.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=900 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/ecb4a65f2c9007fe3acfe3669a347aae.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/ecb4a65f2c9007fe3acfe3669a347aae.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Star Compass. A place that is not really a place.<br>Every soul held by what it cannot let go falls here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI\u2019ll take care of you from now on\u2026\u201d The girl\u2019s words were soft and warm, like water. But in the end, she was gone\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eira refuses to believe that warmth is gone forever. \u201cI will find her!\u201d It\u2019s really hard\u2026 but Eira is not afraid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Star Fire</strong></i> is a hand-drawn Boss Rush action game. You control Eira, facing the Zodiac guardians in 1v1 bullet hell battles, listening to their stories, and gathering Emotional Stardust\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/640cacf6eca9c4c872728a6e8406e9b4.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=900 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/640cacf6eca9c4c872728a6e8406e9b4.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/640cacf6eca9c4c872728a6e8406e9b4.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fresh Hand-Drawn Art Style</i></strong> <br>All characters, environments, and bullet patterns are hand-drawn. Beneath the gentle, healing art style lie twelve stories that refuse to let go\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/23078e2fb48b03a7c67e5c6d9ac72912.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/23078e2fb48b03a7c67e5c6d9ac72912.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/23078e2fb48b03a7c67e5c6d9ac72912.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/322681502f5e6c78f17bd31d351d70a1.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=900 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/322681502f5e6c78f17bd31d351d70a1.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/322681502f5e6c78f17bd31d351d70a1.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>fast and fluid combat</i></strong><br>You control Eira with precision, facing each of the twelve Zodiac guardians in one-on-one boss battles. Dodge, jump, weave through bullets\u2014every fight is a meeting of hearts\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/6465a144917fc1603bf042f8b9a36bb9.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/6465a144917fc1603bf042f8b9a36bb9.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/bc0d804fe10d882c33cdbd9fa6f39026.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=900 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/bc0d804fe10d882c33cdbd9fa6f39026.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/bc0d804fe10d882c33cdbd9fa6f39026.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Diverse Bullet Patterns</i></strong><br>Each Zodiac guardian has her own personality and story, reflected in unique bullet patterns. Some strike like shooting stars, others drift like falling petals\u2026 Every battle tells a different epic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/a46f59c026b03b51e59c527383f37002.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/a46f59c026b03b51e59c527383f37002.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/a46f59c026b03b51e59c527383f37002.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/d9ad2f1225d816d710ec579bdeb0663b.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/d9ad2f1225d816d710ec579bdeb0663b.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/d9ad2f1225d816d710ec579bdeb0663b.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/4acc6db6e05bffa35288253663406ca5.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=900 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/4acc6db6e05bffa35288253663406ca5.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/4acc6db6e05bffa35288253663406ca5.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eira. Age unknown. A cat\u2011eared girl.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cCome with me from now on. Will you stay with me forever\u2026 I wish you were my little sister\u2026\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So hard to understand. Ugh, whatever. I\u2019ll go check the Star Compass. Maybe I\u2019ll figure it out there. Um, if I do\u2026 will I get to see her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/8c568f403e7f7138401b4dc309cdadad.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1298 height=661 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/8d36c85d609bd5188dfc814f30224bbe.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=900 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/8d36c85d609bd5188dfc814f30224bbe.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/8d36c85d609bd5188dfc814f30224bbe.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the Star Compass are twelve guardians, each held in place by some emotion she cannot let go. Only by listening to their stories and unraveling the knots in their hearts will the Emotional Stardust gather. And with each understanding, Eira takes one step closer to \u201cher.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/5de61f0a57fb9fffd36eb9f235b56506.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1286 height=649 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/93a52f676cd60c45e94e7c49bf2775d6.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1280 height=666 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/fe8d3fb92a755e529f5f72f5058315d7.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1282 height=657 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/dd9591867b1b1f2ffca9bae01cf2d2de.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1292 height=662 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/aa81d8120dc618238127210ef4d27e7a.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1289 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/25028ba6439b7baa8a6c9ed0778c79a0.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1285 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/962a7b51df484d69ae0f3694d97472dc.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1276 height=640 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/949beca4dddfc5f2ab1049f15767522f.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1290 height=664 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/6a5df0eeeddf613a39c1730e307b4bac.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1280 height=656 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/580d01bc4bd025e1abd2f81ff75a485b.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1292 height=656 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/3e337bac8fd9f2812815f936e5d7b9ef.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1280 height=656 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/c2b7b777c5af74f88fd6862ce7a41261.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1293 height=654 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/1a9a0d609835c6c590ef4f6dc1951afe.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=900 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/1a9a0d609835c6c590ef4f6dc1951afe.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/1a9a0d609835c6c590ef4f6dc1951afe.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I used to be a programmer. Two years ago, I started learning art from scratch to make this game. Every character, every animation, every bullet pattern was drawn by one person. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why make an anime-style game? Because I\u2019ve loved it since I was a kid. Now I\u2019m finally making the game I\u2019ve always wanted to make. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was the hardest part? Everything. But mostly, just not giving up. There were so many times I wanted to stop, but I kept going. And now it\u2019s here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This is a story about things people can\u2019t let go. I hope you enjoy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you have any thoughts, feel free to reach me by email: <a href=\"mailto:linxian0205@gmail.com\">linxian0205@gmail.com</a></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794670?t=1774513448","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/22515ef373b634d162ec8b8c69c2c1fc1bdef102/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774513448","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/36e43355a15fc9c95b5d67428f0730d13a78ef2b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774513448","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/36e43355a15fc9c95b5d67428f0730d13a78ef2b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774513448","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4355710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/ecb4a65f2c9007fe3acfe3669a347aae.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=900 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/ecb4a65f2c9007fe3acfe3669a347aae.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/ecb4a65f2c9007fe3acfe3669a347aae.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Star Compass. A place that is not really a place.<br>Every soul held by what it cannot let go falls here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cI\u2019ll take care of you from now on\u2026\u201d The girl\u2019s words were soft and warm, like water. But in the end, she was gone\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eira refuses to believe that warmth is gone forever. \u201cI will find her!\u201d It\u2019s really hard\u2026 but Eira is not afraid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Star Fire</strong></i> is a hand-drawn Boss Rush action game. You control Eira, facing the Zodiac guardians in 1v1 bullet hell battles, listening to their stories, and gathering Emotional Stardust\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/640cacf6eca9c4c872728a6e8406e9b4.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=900 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/640cacf6eca9c4c872728a6e8406e9b4.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/640cacf6eca9c4c872728a6e8406e9b4.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Fresh Hand-Drawn Art Style</i></strong> <br>All characters, environments, and bullet patterns are hand-drawn. Beneath the gentle, healing art style lie twelve stories that refuse to let go\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/23078e2fb48b03a7c67e5c6d9ac72912.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/23078e2fb48b03a7c67e5c6d9ac72912.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/23078e2fb48b03a7c67e5c6d9ac72912.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/322681502f5e6c78f17bd31d351d70a1.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=900 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/322681502f5e6c78f17bd31d351d70a1.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/322681502f5e6c78f17bd31d351d70a1.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>fast and fluid combat</i></strong><br>You control Eira with precision, facing each of the twelve Zodiac guardians in one-on-one boss battles. Dodge, jump, weave through bullets\u2014every fight is a meeting of hearts\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/6465a144917fc1603bf042f8b9a36bb9.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1170 height=662 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/6465a144917fc1603bf042f8b9a36bb9.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/bc0d804fe10d882c33cdbd9fa6f39026.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=900 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/bc0d804fe10d882c33cdbd9fa6f39026.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/bc0d804fe10d882c33cdbd9fa6f39026.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Diverse Bullet Patterns</i></strong><br>Each Zodiac guardian has her own personality and story, reflected in unique bullet patterns. Some strike like shooting stars, others drift like falling petals\u2026 Every battle tells a different epic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/a46f59c026b03b51e59c527383f37002.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/a46f59c026b03b51e59c527383f37002.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/a46f59c026b03b51e59c527383f37002.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/d9ad2f1225d816d710ec579bdeb0663b.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/d9ad2f1225d816d710ec579bdeb0663b.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/d9ad2f1225d816d710ec579bdeb0663b.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/4acc6db6e05bffa35288253663406ca5.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=900 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/4acc6db6e05bffa35288253663406ca5.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/4acc6db6e05bffa35288253663406ca5.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eira. Age unknown. A cat\u2011eared girl.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cCome with me from now on. Will you stay with me forever\u2026 I wish you were my little sister\u2026\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So hard to understand. Ugh, whatever. I\u2019ll go check the Star Compass. Maybe I\u2019ll figure it out there. Um, if I do\u2026 will I get to see her?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/8c568f403e7f7138401b4dc309cdadad.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1298 height=661 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/8d36c85d609bd5188dfc814f30224bbe.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=900 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/8d36c85d609bd5188dfc814f30224bbe.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/8d36c85d609bd5188dfc814f30224bbe.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the Star Compass are twelve guardians, each held in place by some emotion she cannot let go. Only by listening to their stories and unraveling the knots in their hearts will the Emotional Stardust gather. And with each understanding, Eira takes one step closer to \u201cher.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/5de61f0a57fb9fffd36eb9f235b56506.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1286 height=649 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/93a52f676cd60c45e94e7c49bf2775d6.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1280 height=666 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/fe8d3fb92a755e529f5f72f5058315d7.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1282 height=657 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/dd9591867b1b1f2ffca9bae01cf2d2de.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1292 height=662 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/aa81d8120dc618238127210ef4d27e7a.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1289 height=658 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/25028ba6439b7baa8a6c9ed0778c79a0.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1285 height=652 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/962a7b51df484d69ae0f3694d97472dc.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1276 height=640 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/949beca4dddfc5f2ab1049f15767522f.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1290 height=664 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/6a5df0eeeddf613a39c1730e307b4bac.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1280 height=656 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/580d01bc4bd025e1abd2f81ff75a485b.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1292 height=656 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/3e337bac8fd9f2812815f936e5d7b9ef.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1280 height=656 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/c2b7b777c5af74f88fd6862ce7a41261.avif?t=1774513448\" width=1293 height=654 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/1a9a0d609835c6c590ef4f6dc1951afe.poster.avif?t=1774513448\" width=900 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/1a9a0d609835c6c590ef4f6dc1951afe.webm?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/1a9a0d609835c6c590ef4f6dc1951afe.mp4?t=1774513448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I used to be a programmer. Two years ago, I started learning art from scratch to make this game. Every character, every animation, every bullet pattern was drawn by one person. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why make an anime-style game? Because I\u2019ve loved it since I was a kid. Now I\u2019m finally making the game I\u2019ve always wanted to make. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was the hardest part? Everything. But mostly, just not giving up. There were so many times I wanted to stop, but I kept going. And now it\u2019s here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This is a story about things people can\u2019t let go. I hope you enjoy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you have any thoughts, feel free to reach me by email: <a href=\"mailto:linxian0205@gmail.com\">linxian0205@gmail.com</a></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["TerraGleam Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/d1324a93201eaed79319427199bee9dd597fccff/header.jpg?t=1774513448","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3794670/1348403822/4b67f3e1d3a25782bad8780b9f0f1702cb3da3b4/1773904121/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773904882","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3794670/1348403822/4b67f3e1d3a25782bad8780b9f0f1702cb3da3b4/1773904121/dash_h264.mpd